    12	/// Keyed by EMPLOYEE rather than by settlement, because that is how it gets used: a name comes
    13	/// back through recruitment years later and somebody needs to know what happened, long after
    14	/// anyone remembers a case number. <c>FNFSettlementID</c> is kept as provenance only and is
    15	/// nullable, so a record can also be written for somebody who left before this module existed.
